# T-38 (#38): allowlist. Everything is excluded unless listed below, so .env
# files, SQLite databases, outboxes, browser profiles/storage state, .git and
# local caches can never enter the build context or an image layer.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!bf_price_monitor/
!scripts/*.py
!data/watchlist.json
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
